Package: m17-bridge
Version: 0.9.0
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: systemd, libc6 (>= 2.34)
Maintainer: Karel Kadlec (OK1LBC) <xkk@post.cz>
Homepage: https://github.com/jancona/m17
Description: M17 Messaging Bridge for APRS
 Standalone M17 inet messaging bridge configured for APRS-IS.
 It makes M17 hotspots/repeaters look like reflectors for SMS and GNSS
 position traffic and forwards messages and position reports to APRS-IS.
 A built-in web dashboard (port 17080) lists the messages that passed
 through the bridge and can send an M17 SMS to the connected radio.
 The package contains the bridge binary, an APRS-only configuration file
 and a systemd unit.
